## Gebruikte Technologieën

* **Hardware**: Heltec WiFi LoRa 32 V4, Orange Pi
* **Firmware**: C++, PlatformIO, ESP-IDF Deep Sleep
* **Netwerk & Protocol**: Meshcore
* **Gateway & Backend**: Python, SQLite, Docker & Docker Compose
* **Frontend**: SvelteKit, TypeScript, Tailwind CSS
